msgstr "Vínculo dinámico aplicado correctamente."

#: includes/abilities.php:8420
msgid "Elementor: Get Structure"
msgstr "Elementor: Obtener estructura"

#: includes/abilities.php:8421
msgid ""
"Returns a compact, flattened tree of an Elementor page/template: every "
"element with its id, depth, type, and a short text preview. Read-only. Use "
"this to locate element ids before editing."
msgstr ""
"Devuelve un árbol compacto y aplanado de una página o plantilla de "
"Elementor: cada elemento con su ID, profundidad, tipo y una vista previa "
"corta del texto. Solo lectura. Úsalo para localizar los IDs de los elementos "
"antes de editar."

#: includes/abilities.php:8459 includes/abilities.php:8595
msgid "This post has no _elementor_data."
msgstr "Esta entrada no tiene _elementor_data."

#: includes/abilities.php:8524
msgid "Elementor: Update Element"
msgstr "Elementor: Actualizar elemento"

#: includes/abilities.php:8525
msgid ""
"Updates the settings of a single Elementor element by id (static content or "
"styles). Provided keys are merged into the element settings; other keys are "
"preserved. Examples: {\"title\":\"New heading\"} for a heading, {\"text\":"
"\"Click\"} for a button, {\"editor\":\"<p>HTML</p>\"} for a text-editor. "
"Saves and clears Elementor cache. Batch mode: pass an edits[] array to "
"update multiple elements in a single call."
msgstr ""
"Actualiza los ajustes de un elemento individual de Elementor por ID "
"(contenido estático o estilos). Las claves proporcionadas se combinan con "
"los ajustes del elemento; el resto se conserva. Ejemplos: {\"title\":\"Nuevo "
"encabezado\"} para un encabezado, {\"text\":\"Clic\"} para un botón, "
"{\"editor\":\"<p>HTML</p>\"} para un editor de texto. Guarda y limpia la "
"caché de Elementor. Modo por lotes: pasa un array edits[] para actualizar "
"varios elementos en una sola llamada."

#: includes/abilities.php:8590
msgid "Provide either (element_id + settings) or a non-empty edits[] array."
msgstr "Proporciona (element_id + settings) o un array edits[] no vacío."

#: includes/abilities.php:8622
msgid "None of the given element ids were found in _elementor_data."
msgstr ""
"Ninguno de los IDs de elemento indicados se encontró en _elementor_data."

#. translators: 1: updated count, 2: not-found count
#: includes/abilities.php:8641
#, php-format
msgid "%1$d element(s) updated, %2$d not found."
msgstr "%1$d elemento(s) actualizado(s), %2$d no encontrado(s)."

#: includes/abilities.php:8669
