msgstr "El documento de metadatos del conector no incluye redirect_uris."

#: includes/oauth-connectors.php:618
msgid "The connector does not offer the authorization_code grant."
msgstr "El conector no admite el tipo de concesión authorization_code."

#. translators: %s: the callback URL the connector wants to use
#: includes/oauth-connectors.php:631
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The connector wants to send users back to %s, which is not in this site's "
"allowed callback URLs. Add it under Settings › WP Abilities › Connection › "
"Allowed callback URLs, then try again."
msgstr ""
"El conector quiere devolver a los usuarios a %s, que no está entre las URLs "
"de callback permitidas de este sitio. Añádela en Ajustes › WP Abilities › "
"Conexión › URLs de callback permitidas y vuelve a intentarlo."

#. translators: %s: the rejected callback URL
#: includes/oauth-connectors.php:758
#, php-format
msgid "%s is not in the allowed callback URLs list."
msgstr "%s no está en la lista de URLs de callback permitidas."

#: includes/oauth-connectors.php:770
msgid "At least one redirect_uri is required."
msgstr "Se requiere al menos un redirect_uri."

#: includes/oauth-connectors.php:774
msgid "Too many redirect_uris."
msgstr "Demasiados redirect_uris."

#: includes/oauth-connectors.php:787
msgid "Unsupported token_endpoint_auth_method."
msgstr "token_endpoint_auth_method no admitido."

#: includes/oauth-connectors.php:1112 includes/oauth-connectors.php:1167
#: includes/oauth-connectors.php:1175 includes/oauth-connectors.php:1189
msgid "OAuth Error"
msgstr "Error de OAuth"

#: includes/oauth-connectors.php:1131
msgid ""
"That is a metadata URL, but its host is not among this site's allowed "
"callback URLs, so the document is never fetched. Add a callback URL on that "
"host under Settings › WP Abilities › Connection."
msgstr ""
"Es una URL de metadatos, pero su host no está entre las URLs de callback "
"permitidas de este sitio, así que el documento nunca se descarga. Añade una "
"URL de callback de ese host en Ajustes › WP Abilities › Conexión."

#: includes/oauth-connectors.php:1132
msgid ""
"That is an opaque ID, so it should have been issued by this site. Remove and "
"re-add the connector so it registers itself, or create a client under "
"Settings › WP Abilities › Connection and paste that exact Client ID."
msgstr ""
"Es un ID opaco, así que debería haberlo emitido este sitio. Elimina y vuelve "
"a añadir el conector para que se registre, o crea un cliente en Ajustes › WP "
"Abilities › Conexión y pega exactamente ese Client ID."

#. translators: 1: the client ID the connector presented, 2: what to do about it
#: includes/oauth-connectors.php:1138
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This connector is not registered on this site. It presented the client ID: "
"%1$s — %2$s"
msgstr ""
"Este conector no está registrado en este sitio. Presentó el Client ID: %1$s "
"— %2$s"

#: includes/oauth-connectors.php:1143
msgid "Unknown OAuth client"
msgstr "Cliente OAuth desconocido"

#: includes/oauth-connectors.php:1167
msgid "Third-party OAuth connectors are disabled on this site."
msgstr "Los conectores OAuth de terceros están desactivados en este sitio."

#: includes/oauth-connectors.php:1175
msgid "redirect_uri is required."
msgstr "redirect_uri es obligatorio."

#: includes/oauth-connectors.php:1189
msgid "redirect_uri does not match an allowed callback URL."
msgstr "redirect_uri no coincide con ninguna URL de callback permitida."
